Package: com.itsallexb.pagescale
Name: PageScale (iOS 6-7)
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Makes web pages in Safari smaller on iOS 6 and 7, so modern sites made for bigger phones stop looking cramped. Pages are laid out wider and shown smaller, like zooming out in a desktop browser, so links, forms, pinch zoom and rotation keep working. 80% by default, 50-100% in Settings > Page Scale. Works with Web Port.
Maintainer: itsAllexB
Author: itsAllexB
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 8.0)
